Comment: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:35.54,Karaoke - 22 the coronation 1,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k48}Yo{\k43}ko{\k27}so {\k25}yo{\k25}ko{\k26}so {\k26}u{\k22}re{\k23}shi {\k47}u{\k28}re{\k44}shi {\k115}da{\k107}i {\k134}ka{\k67}n{\k541}ki
Comment: 0,0:13:22.06,0:13:35.54,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Welcome, welcome! We're so happy, what great joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.48,0:13:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Great Jubilee is finally tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparations at the castle are nearly complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,, and delegates from around the world are arriving one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead of this major ceremony, Prince Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is surely resting calmly, awaiting the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear God, please grant me courage and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.85,0:14:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so terrified of living a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dawn is already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear God, please protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Apothecary Ponko, is that poison ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehe, it's almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just three more hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, work faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time for the Jubilee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be ready, it'll be ready! Plenty of time before the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How effective is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,One sip and they'll blab whatever's on their mind. It's plenty potent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If it isn't ready in time, I'll chop off your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait right here until it's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.77,0:14:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.28,0:14:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thirsty. Got any booze?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.13,0:14:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,On the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ponko, what kind of booze is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You grabbed the wrong one, Mr. Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a weight-gain potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A weight-gain potion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something! Give me a cure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no quick cure for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll stay like that until it wears off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything will do! A weight-loss potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ponko?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be back to normal by the time the potion is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.03,0:15:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, why don't you take a nice little nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin Prince Sapphire's grand coronation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.57,0:16:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everything goes smoothly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The grand coronation ceremony is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Representatives from around the world, dressed in fine attire,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,eagerly await the Prince's arrival with bated breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Prince Sapphire takes this throne, Silverland will welcome its new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.82,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, I want something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh! Be patient, there will be a feast later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.03,0:16:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll give you some candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.68,0:17:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sapphire, I pray the ceremony goes smoothly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.44,0:17:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth is Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't shown up at the hall yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Presenting Prince Sapphire and Her Majesty the Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Accompanied by the choir, the Prince finally makes his entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, we shall proceed with the crowning ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.51,0:18:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it has over a hundred diamonds on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, it has at least two hundred!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.07,0:19:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Grace, Nylon has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.89,0:19:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him to hurry up and mix the drug into the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke ordered us to mix the potion into the Queen's wine right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.74,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who got the medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I should put it in the Queen's glass myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You go rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I said {\i1}I'll{\i0} do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go take a rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, we shall proceed to the toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I will now pour the celebratory wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Once poured, please do not drink until instructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.02,0:19:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin, please lead the toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Is that glass for the Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.67,0:20:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's as good as ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.18,0:20:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, a toast to King Sapphire and Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grand Duke Duralumin!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.24,0:20:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.08,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, take Mother to her room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.79,0:21:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right now, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew keeping this secret alone would be so painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to reveal everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.08,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire... my child Sapphire is actually a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.25,0:21:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To put her on the throne, they forced her to pose as a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you all hear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, that is a direct confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,For 13 years, this mother and child lied and deceived the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards who deceived the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:22:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um... did I say something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've confessed to everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.48,0:22:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.24,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrest these traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And seize those three henchmen of theirs, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is punishment for deceiving the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire and the Queen shall be locked in the Coffin Tower for life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.92,0:22:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely no one objects!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.63,0:22:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Coffin Tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,For life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As for those three, for aiding traitors, they'll be slaves in the quarry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Slaves in the quarry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.49,0:22:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the new throne, my son Plastic shall sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No one objects to King Plastic, I presume!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.48,0:22:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Drag the criminals away!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.82,0:22:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Prince Sapphire—or rather, Princess Sapphire—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.05,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and Her Majesty, I am afraid you must step into the prison carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.47,0:23:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.88,0:23:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother we fell right into Duralumin's trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've been made to drink poisoned wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be seeing each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.31,0:24:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That over there is the Coffin Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.63,0:24:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I pity you, Princess Sapphire, but once you go in there, you'll never leave until you're nothing but bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.18,0:24:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself!
